with rolling-origin + 1SE hysteresis carried across the walk and
per-retrain Elo-K tuning. As-of property pinned in both directions at
1e-12. Report: BACKTEST section, per-tier + per-tier-by-half-year
metrics only, retrain log with calibrator + n_val_rows, synthetic
watermark; rebuild-from-rows mode so report-format changes never force
a re-walk. Runner: run-once enforced (replace only on shipped-version
change, old result archived), gzipped per-match audit rows, market join
labeled BACKTEST, --push/--push-only. API: GET /api/backtest + token-
guarded ingest. Frontend: separated Backtest panel. Validation run on
the corrected store: 6487 predictions / 97 retrains / 701s; findings in
LOG entry 31 (early-era weakness + the July-2025 isotonic admission
episode; recent era agrees with the static report). ASSUMPTIONS §16;
MODEL_CARD backtest section; APPLY §9 runbook. Tests 95 -> 101.
